@startuml
' Figure 27-4: the compile-time / run-time boundary. The installed Par is the seam.
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam defaultFontName monospaced
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #4A5568
  FontColor #1A202C
}
skinparam ArrowColor #4A5568
top to bottom direction

title Figure 27-4 — the compile-time / run-time boundary

package "COMPILE TIME (once per language)" #E1EFFA {
  rectangle "1. parse language! -> LanguageDef (GSLT)" as K1 #C6E0F5
  rectangle "2. intern the set-automaton quotient (tc(K))" as K2 #F6C177
  rectangle "3. classify rules (RhoNetProgram)" as K3 #C6E0F5
  rectangle "4. serialize matching | firing | congruence" as K4 #C6E0F5
  rectangle "5. fail-closed install gate" as K5 #C6E0F5
  K1 --> K2
  K2 --> K3
  K3 --> K4
  K4 --> K5
}

rectangle "<b>installed rhoapi::Par</b>   (the seam)" as SEAM #A7D8B6
K5 --> SEAM

package "RUN TIME (once per subject, on RSpace)" #E6F4EA {
  rectangle "6. M-reflect the subject term" as R6 #A7D8B6
  rectangle "7. spread onto loc: / col: / cap:" as R7 #A7D8B6
  rectangle "8. locate & match (sa: / eq: tau COMMs)" as R8 #A7D8B6
  rectangle "9. fire: one visible COMM per redex" as R9 #7FC79B
  rectangle "10. congruence cascade (beta only)" as R10 #A7D8B6
  rectangle "11. decode the resting EList" as R11 #A7D8B6
  R6 --> R7
  R7 --> R8
  R8 --> R9
  R9 --> R10
  R10 --> R11
}
SEAM --> R6

note right of SEAM #FCF3D0
  Structural congruence is closed at COMPILE time by the e-graph;
  only beta-substitution congruence runs at run time. Each COMM is
  metered by the cost-accounting extension (separate from OSLF).
end note
@enduml
